# councillormosley — Councillor Mosley's entire conversation, every quest he appears in.
#
# A quests/dialogue/ file: DIALOGUE blocks and NO QUEST block. The importer and
# Tools -> Content -> Validate Quests both refuse either mistake. See
# docs/reference/QUEST_TEXT_FORMAT.md.
#
# ⚠ THIS FILE OWNS COUNCILLOR MOSLEY'S CONVERSATION. One DIALOGUE block per npcId across the
# whole quests/ tree: each import regenerates Dialogue_councillormosley.asset wholesale, so a
# second file declaring DIALOGUE councillormosley would clobber this one. Every future Mosley
# quest adds its nodes HERE, gated on its own quest id.
#
# The quests whose beats live in this file:
#   mosley_vape_quest_one  - quests/mosley_vape_quest_one.quest  (granted and completed here)
#   daniel_pauls_quest_one - quests/daniel_pauls_quest_one.quest (granted here at nag_two;
#                            completed in quests/dialogue/danielpauls.quest)

DIALOGUE councillormosley
# councillormosley matches Preset_CouncillorMosley's filename (Preset_ prefix stripped,
# case-insensitive) — the importer wires this conversation into that preset's Conversation
# field automatically.

NODE start
SPEAKER: councillormosley
SPEAK: Christ.. what have I done? You! no.. no.. leave me be...
CHOICE Come on what's up? Caught with the intern again? -> reveal_prompt
GATE: not-started mosley_vape_quest_one
CHOICE Christ, I'm on it alright. *leaves* -> nag_one
GATE: active mosley_vape_quest_one
CHOICE Don't gotta tell me twice. *leaves*

NODE reveal_prompt
SPEAKER: councillormosley
SPEAK: AH! I don't have time to care if you'll spread this. You've probably noticed a bit of an uptick in uh...
CHOICE Nittys about the place? -> reveal_a
CHOICE Can you spit it out? -> reveal_b

NODE reveal_a
SPEAKER: councillormosley
SPEAK: YES! Well, no.. they're just misunderstood.. Anyway, I tried to calm them down. I'd asked ChatJeeves LLM and.. well 3 hours laters I had the vape of all vapes in my palm. I was told it'd chill the oiks down but fucking hell old boy, they're anything but calm.
CHOICE Alright cool. And you're telling me because? -> ask_why_1
CHOICE Sounds tasty, a toot for me perchance old boy? -> ask_why_2

NODE reveal_b
SPEAKER: councillormosley
SPEAK: Right okay. Had a chat with AI, came up with a little proto-type chill out vape. Decided to test it out on a few of the local ruffians.
CHOICE Alright cool. And you're telling me because? -> ask_why_1
CHOICE Sounds tasty, a toot for me perchance old boy? -> ask_why_2

NODE ask_why_1
SPEAKER: councillormosley
SPEAK: I've spoken to Daniel, I know you can sling spells. I'll tell the federalis if you don't help me out old boy. Give me a hand and there's a few quid in it for you. Please! *eyes begin to tear up*
CHOICE Well since you asked nicely, go on then. -> end_accept
GRANT: mosley_vape_quest_one
CHOICE Fuck off. *leaves* -> end_decline

NODE ask_why_2
SPEAKER: councillormosley
SPEAK: They're fucking zombies you fool. I'll tell you where they are just get back the vape. If that get's out it's Black Mamba 2.0, this place becomes Manchester.
CHOICE Uh oh.. maybe not then.. so what do you want from me? -> ask_why_1
CHOICE Ok I'm out *leaves*

NODE end_accept
SPEAKER: councillormosley
SPEAK: Excellent. I've written the details in your little diary. I'll be here when you're done. Go on then, chop chop!!!

NODE end_decline
SPEAKER: councillormosley
SPEAK: AH! I'll be here if you change your mind. *weeps*

NODE nag_one
SPEAKER: councillormosley
SPEAK: COME ON CHAP! GET ME THAT VAPE AND DO NOT CHONG ON IT!
CHOICE Ooooookay. -> nag_two

NODE nag_two
SPEAKER: councillormosley
SPEAK: WHAT ARE YOU DOING??? I CAN PRACTICALLY HEAR THEM HUFFING ON THAT VAPE FROM HERE CHAP HURRY!!!
CHOICE Mate how does a vape make them get like that? You slapping fent in these? -> vape_returned
ITEM: cherry_mango_vape x1 consume
COMPLETE: mosley_vape_quest_one
GRANT: daniel_pauls_quest_one
CHOICE Gimme some time man.

NODE vape_returned
SPEAKER: councillormosley
SPEAK: Good man, sorting that out for me. You should get back to Daniel Paul's. I hear he's in a spot of bother.
CHOICE Okay.
